{
  "module": "kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "ba81890c2028f2c003829308abda7c67",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "818b52972fdb3843dfcd6fcd5b0030f22a122624615f518f356b403e9f3b709d",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "また、一年に一度の募集の季節が来た",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f406259836c15034b2a1a54dd082b0f9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "7440e9c740dd924830777f85c5350fb40103a22c76ba2d001b8c057ec803bbd2",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "選抜レース以外にも、日常の合宿の模擬レースには、新人を探すトレーナーが足を止めることがある",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4320b1995d7e708960cdf8e7d6a6fd64",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "a42d6e5b4c749430fca04859a9deaca49195f7fd626e2211f555736a9e0de8a2",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "たとえば、今この場面のように——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "89312430b8413f5288d7db32d35c5ce4",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "1754a1f285234fe41be2a5cb8f9aef4b8bd86a5f29fb91f7c8d75a68d4bb2aa1",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "終盤で、いきなり踏み込む",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c537ec487e09762f39fec8b2897b03cb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "99310843d1446d0408842d4e607abd19a80fc6d715a440d5c79104c4555080d5",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "隊列の最後尾から、加速、加速、加速。相手を一人、また一人と抜き去る",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3436434ac2099261b9973972218eb78a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "6cb49119b3137f052550c609a8ea532f17e773cfd208ab8ad65a9b2cd361878d",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "すべてを一掃して、勝利を手にした",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b577833d8840c3214f5575ad78cc66c1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "ce95ff27dde6b03301bfab7f7f0825d7d5c80c6fd0a87c831c8e1dcc32da179e",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "目の前の小さなウマ%UMA%の名は %CHARA%。最近、多くのトレーナーが話題にする新人だ",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d8ae6eac92246b076a4844a400f737a8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "d72372de4948c8fea5a631768057ab32105c8fe52151327d52cf1afeafde3432",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "魔法に夢中らしいが、なぜか担当トレーナーがまだ決まっていないウマ%UMA%だという",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a8c0f04262d1da40bc2b37c14d1dca8b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "d6fa2ebab2fcf0e9572dc4ce7f2b729de680ddf53a88d218c4b19a3c31b44933",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "新人を掴むなら、まずは声をかけるところから",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "05a70557e6192ac415a96608bd21631a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "fc0dce7d1acd839b5bd25f3886e16871e311307aff1038abfa4b87367d7ef906",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "噂の情報を使うにせよ、本気の誠実さで行くにせよ……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ed58785bf730adb29fb4561e3a509997",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "881e48a26adefe5964c88cca592191a19c755c5829442dceadfa8a554c7ceda8",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "そうして、%CHARA% の模擬レースが終わり、小さなウマ%UMA%がトレーニング場を離れていくのを見て、%YOU%は決めた——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e6bb3c5bcf9ed50d975ef4663dc63259",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "de15771d9c96c8abceebb64f003369f9d28d671a4a365d08e6383e07a6dc443f",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「さっきの、まるで『魔法』みたいだった——」（募集を試す）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f6bdf7db77b6d24bf4188136a7c1a6a3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "a3b3ff30b115745d41369c3f454f3acb04bbde862b6e60e011c5fa70c5ac4b9e",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "噂のあの言葉を、わざと使った。計略ではある",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a44ca32a47fb0355be302164c9694d52",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6cc62d6a899a8de435ebd85c24dec206bdf9c4d1d74dab38bed962b112bc8d2e",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "だが計略でも、それは紛れもなく%YOU%の本音だった",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "814e49aa3a730e463706714a94dbceeb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "24037c737dd6ace4ac4ea0edfe9f2ae44e01f78d72c66a136ab07d5d2a4bc173",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%の走り、あの速さ、あの衝撃は、新人ウマ%UMA%の名に十分値する",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "42e2fa0e3ed5d14e9981bffa3dd60d47",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "4e17ce304a27a301d7274d8b158c596af2b1a2c4ca66b95e896d4eb58524b017",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "あれほどの走りを『魔法』と呼ばないなら……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "442a224d719b2f9e58840911338ecc52",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "56accd0bbf39fa6eee94064e60806d6fde018e47a1b3d375e0ee5ca49f9d3a9c",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "『魔法』と呼べるのは、きっとこれから先、%CHARA%がさらに先へ行った走りだけだ",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2e469b3f47dcafea074066bc876ab140",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        7,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b7c5619a15c8022ee69e7c132ca19ce531f5d35259566285a0671998dc9ff1c2",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「！ねえ、今、私の走りを何て言った！？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "01e199bbb6c57bc47be394ac501adcd2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "436cdb6ea97910ba2a1fe2d8fb004e774b2dbfa8bb2b5f686fb1a944142549ff",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "案の定、すぐに食いついた。帽子の小さなウマ%UMA%が、%YOU%のそばを通り過ぎる寸前で足を止める",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "373f0471bf37b025136d6b719444fe27",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "e2639c36f8a73edb190e433a7dbd300256e2a93a2017c37ccd38fb1951d924e0",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "この年頃の小さなウマ%UMA%なら、スイーツは嫌わないはず——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b6b527c119dc4e1d191c86a4de66cff6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "d8a5bc270e5be5040a167449bf024b88ef9376867eba0eec21a886e5366b1ac5",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "そう思い、%YOU%は%CHARA%を誘った",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d62703653517727271e13cd106286461",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "2dd366dba0f6356896a29854372c4749747dcb9f307a58b6967e524fadff21e5",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "今、%YOU%と%CHARA%はスイーツ店で向かい合い、それぞれフルーツパフェを前にしている",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1944d126df9d5d1199ba2876676f7bcc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        14,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "20c601c4dd6f8184cbc5632654cbb76bcbc6dfb4a86e2fc25cfee59919d0bacc",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「ねえ！さっき、私の走りが『魔法』みたいだって。どういう意味！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7381ab878db87835033c2cd74243f65b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        15,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "0899dc2bd78d7f808d16830e8c1705ab90f83f8d00bf5cc162a9aa66602d13a7",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「もしかして、あなたも魔法が使えるの！？隠棲してる大魔法使いとか！？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "faa85f7bfaee004231446984cd572cb0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        17
      ],
      "originalHash": "406dfb8037b0de4dab0a3d409f65b78308442f759298eb4966d93fe6655c211a",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "目の前の小さなウマ%UMA%は、とても乗り気だ",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d4db7500efe6a1d3f14ca98367dc8439",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        18
      ],
      "originalHash": "4fac2a0d1409ba70d2af858c4d83ae1a2f82cd4e51b798abf59ffc5cb9a7c3a3",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "とりあえず、話を合わせておけば大丈夫だろう——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1959856f229527810711ef3c719de114",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        19
      ],
      "originalHash": "e68c7bb6986dcbb46d5a30aab2d3fccfae9aa34254aa6cf2a12ab9983621f1a6",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「魔法なら、少しは知ってる」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3437290c5c1245ca8a043e2680e5b535",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        21,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "37ad262018d9aa48cef1a06959cb6d9c5312b1645a0b40994efa8cb747c1c7fd",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「どんな魔法が使えるの！？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "52c2d5c7002058478dcf335dc39d3289",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/104400-Sweep-Tosho/rec-44.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        14,
        "lines",
        23,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "335bf05f6405b73f8d27f7d999809f20af8d4d6bc7227317e776110fa87382a2",
      "sourceFileHash": "3ae54c6393dd6ca81f930ee7c89ab4a20b9d1d0619f2bc2735a950e396dd324c",
      "originalText": "「たぶん、『運動』に関する魔法だね」",
